            <description><![CDATA[<p><em>Calmer to hear, bigger to see, in your colour.</em></p>
<h3>New</h3>
<ul><li>Choose the countdown colour — green is the new default instead of red</li><li>Link to the developer&#x27;s website in Settings</li></ul>
<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul><li>The breathing circle fills the screen and shifts colour with your breath</li><li>Calmer tones: gentler onset, softer closing tone, its own cue for holding</li></ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul><li>The menu bar time was blurry on high-resolution displays</li><li>The countdown panel was out of proportion on large displays</li><li>The bilateral exercise ended on the wrong tone</li></ul>
]]></description>
